1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,224
Lamplight helps IHH coordinators work toward their two-hour response goal.

2
00:00:04,224 --> 00:00:09,983
For the coordinator, that means faxed pages, missing records, and another hospital to call.

3
00:00:09,983 --> 00:00:14,321
Lamplight brings the evidence and the next step into one place.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:18,861
Start with a four-step welcome, built for staff.

5
00:00:18,861 --> 00:00:22,080
Then one queue, with owners and deadlines.

6
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:28,439
These invented practice patients use answer-key reviews passed through app checks, not live AI extraction.

7
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:33,830
Open this stroke referral. The form suggests independence.

8
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:37,813
But page eleven says the patient cannot walk, transfer, bathe,

9
00:00:37,813 --> 00:00:40,443
dress, or toilet without hands-on help.

10
00:00:40,443 --> 00:00:45,631
The coordinator can open that exact page, instead of trusting the form alone.

11
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:49,694
Each flag links a rule to the original words.

12
00:00:49,694 --> 00:00:52,755
Conflicts stay visible. Missing evidence stays unknown.

13
00:00:52,755 --> 00:00:57,243
Rules that need elapsed hours remain can't tell when dates are removed.

14
00:00:57,243 --> 00:00:59,643
Only the clinical reviewer can deny.

15
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:03,013
Missing records become one clear draft.

16
00:01:03,013 --> 00:01:05,376
Staff review and send it.

17
00:01:05,376 --> 00:01:06,937
Lamplight sends nothing.

18
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:14,137
For clients, staff can review local resources and print a clear PDF handout to take away.

19
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:21,041
The same referral and draft, in English.

20
00:01:21,041 --> 00:01:25,737
Switch to Espa?ol: labels, summaries, questions, and drafts translate.

21
00:01:25,737 --> 00:01:27,302
Quotes stay original.

22
00:01:27,302 --> 00:01:31,637
Staff check AI translations. IHH bilingual review is pending.

23
00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:36,830
Staff resolve questions and record acceptance.

24
00:01:36,830 --> 00:01:38,812
Handoff drafts follow: chart fields,

25
00:01:38,812 --> 00:01:41,879
the census row, and the site email.

26
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:45,581
An admin can review who did what and when.

27
00:01:47,250 --> 00:01:50,877
It never says yes or no. You do.

28
00:01:50,877 --> 00:01:54,541
This local prototype connects to no real IHH systems.

29
00:01:54,541 --> 00:01:57,464
Staff must validate accuracy before a pilot.

30
00:01:57,464 --> 00:01:59,648
The goal: fewer lost referrals.
